Package: rscprep
Title: Prepare Single-Cell RNA-Seq Data for Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mike", "Martinez", , "mike.j.martinez99@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads Cell Ranger output into Seurat objects, annotates them
    with sample-level metadata, and calculates the per-cell quality control
    metrics that filtering decisions are made from. Handles both the
    'cellranger count' and 'cellranger multi' output layouts behind one
    interface, flags outlier cells by median absolute deviation either
    globally or within sample, and records the thresholds it applied so that
    what was removed, and why, stays inspectable afterwards.
